@startuml togaf-data
title TOGAF 数据架构（Phase C）- WhatsFeed
skinparam shadowing false

archimate #Application "NestJS API" as Api <<application-component>>

package "逻辑数据对象" {
  archimate #Application "User" as DUser <<data-object>>
  archimate #Application "Chat / Message" as DMsg <<data-object>>
  archimate #Application "Post / FeedEntry" as DPost <<data-object>>
  archimate #Application "Comment / Notification" as DComment <<data-object>>
  archimate #Application "Engagement" as DEngage <<data-object>>
  archimate #Application "Follow" as DFollow <<data-object>>
  archimate #Application "MediaObject" as DMedia <<data-object>>
}

archimate #Technology "PostgreSQL" as Pg <<system-software>>
archimate #Technology "Redis" as Redis <<system-software>>
archimate #Technology "Cassandra" as Cas <<system-software>>
archimate #Technology "MongoDB" as Mongo <<system-software>>
archimate #Technology "Elasticsearch" as Es <<system-software>>

Api --> DUser : Access
Api --> DMsg : Access
Api --> DPost : Access
Api --> DComment : Access
Api --> DEngage : Access
Api --> DFollow : Access
Api --> DMedia : Access

DUser ..> Pg : Realization
DMsg ..> Pg : Realization
DFollow ..> Pg : Realization
DPost ..> Cas : Realization
DEngage ..> Cas : Realization
DComment ..> Mongo : Realization
DPost ..> Redis : Flow
DUser ..> Es : Flow

note bottom
  PostgreSQL + Redis：生产 MVP 必需。
  Cassandra / Mongo / ES：可选，缺失时能力降级。
  Flow = 缓存或索引同步路径。
end note

@enduml
